cumentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" of Mixpanel’s track API, so an "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" can send"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events to a Mixpanel project’s "},{"code":"POST \/track","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"MixpanelBatchEncoder","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}